---
const IG_URL =
  'https://www.instagram.com/tri_leadclass?utm_source=ig_web_button_share_sheet&igsh=ZDNlZDc0MzIxNw==';
---

<footer class="bg-slate-900 text-white pt-16 pb-8">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-12 border-b border-slate-700 pb-12">
      <div class="col-span-1 md:col-span-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="site-footer-logo site-footer-logo--tri">
              <img src="/icon/icon.png" alt="" width="53" height="53" />
            </span>
            <img src="/icon/untaq.png" alt="" width="40" height="40" class="h-10 w-10 object-contain shrink-0" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-black tracking-widest text-white uppercase leading-none">
              TRI_LEADCLASS<span class="text-emerald-500">.</span>
            </h2>
            <p class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.12em] sm:tracking-[0.15em] text-emerald-400/80 font-semibold mt-1 leading-snug">
              Universitas At-Taqwa · Angkatan ke-3 · Kelas B
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-400 max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Jurnal ilmiah yang didedikasikan untuk menerbitkan riset unggulan, kajian teoritis, dan
          praktik terbaik dalam ruang lingkup Manajemen Pendidikan Islam secara komprehensif.
        </p>
        <a
          href={IG_URL}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-400 hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors"
          aria-label="Instagram TRI_LEADCLASS"
        >
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect width="20" height="20" x="2" y="2" rx="5" ry="5"/>
            <path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"/>
            <line x1="17.5" x2="17.51" y1="6.5" y2="6.5"/>
          </svg>
          <span class="text-sm font-medium">@tri_leadclass</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold text-slate-300 mb-4">Edisi Jurnal</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-400">
          <li><a href="/halaman/arsip-volume" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Arsip Volume</a></li>
          <li><a href="/halaman/edisi-khusus-mpi" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Edisi Khusus MPI</a></li>
          <li><a href="/halaman/panduan-penulis" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Panduan Penulis (OJS)</a></li>
          <li><a href="/dewan-redaksi" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Dewan Redaksi (Editorial Board)</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold text-slate-300 mb-4">Kebijakan</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-400">
          <li><a href="/halaman/akses-terbuka" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Akses Terbuka (Open Access)</a></li>
          <li><a href="/halaman/etika-publikasi" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Etika Publikasi (COPE)</a></li>
          <li><a href="/halaman/pernyataan-plagiarisme" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Pernyataan Plagiarisme</a></li>
          <li><a href="/halaman/kontak-bantuan" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Kontak & Bantuan</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pt-8 text-center md:text-left text-slate-500 text-xs">
      &copy; 2026 Tri Leadclass Journal Publishing. All rights reserved. Dikelola oleh Departemen
      Manajemen Pendidikan Islam.
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
